## Rebuild from the original sources

`source/` holds `project.yaml`, any supplied input files, and `cache/` with every original download this package was built from (`provenance.json` lists publisher, URL, query and retrieval date for each). `tools/` holds the kit. On a computer with QGIS 3.34 or later and its Python, from this folder:

```
python3 tools/transportation-gis/scripts/tgis.py doctor
python3 tools/transportation-gis/scripts/tgis.py build source --offline
```

The rebuilt package appears under `source/build/`. `--offline` makes any download attempt an error, so the rebuild uses only what is in this folder. To check this package against its checksums: `python3 tools/transportation-gis/scripts/tgis.py verify .`

